* Basic Information
At Tata Consumer Products, we stand 'For better' - a reflection of our commitment to improving, by pushing boundaries and aiming higher, every day, for all our stakeholders. Our product portfolio under Beverages spans tea, coffee, and liquid beverages such as water and ready-to-drink offerings. Our Foods portfolio includes salt, pulses, spices, ready-to-cook mixes, cereals, snacks and mini-meals. Our Out-Of-Home Retail portfolio comprises social hubs providing unique and authentic experiences centred on the joy of sharing moments and meals.
