Established in 2000, Organic India was born from a collective dream of providing certified organic products while uplifting farmer communities and advocating for sustainable agriculture. Today, our extensive lineup includes a variety of whole herb health supplements, teas, infusions, body care essentials, and packaged foods.
Founded in 2000, Organic India emerged from a shared vision of offering certified organic products while supporting farmer communities and promoting sustainable agriculture. Today, our diverse portfolio encompasses whole herb health supplements, teas, infusions, body care range and packaged foods.
Our Packaged Foods category features a rich assortment of certified organic cereals, pulses, grains, nuts & seeds, cold-pressed oils, spices, natural sweeteners like jaggery and multi-floral honey and healthy foods including Apple Cider Vinegar, Chyawanprash and more.
We work closely with farmers and tribal wildcrafters across India to support ancient good agriculture practices, and preserve natural habitats, honouring nature's wisdom in every step.
Through this dedicated approach, we endeavour that our packaged foods are free from synthetic pesticides, GMOs, and growth hormones. This commitment ensures that every morsel not only delivers wholesome nutrition but also captures the authentic flavours inherent to organic ingredients, safeguarding the well-being of your entire family.
While all our packaged foods comply with all organic regulations in India, we go the extra mile, holding global certifications including HACCP, GMP, ISO 9001-2015, Kosher, and Organic Certifications from Control Union and SGS, meeting USDA, EU, and NPOP Organic Standards to ensure purity every step of the way.
Embrace a nourishing journey with Organic India today, and make the choice for wholesome nutrition that nurtures the well-being of your loved ones.
