Tata Tea Extractions, Inc. (TTEI), in the US is a wholly owned subsidiary supplying cold water-soluble Instant Tea powders and Instant Green Tea. The TTEI facility also enables the production of value-added products as per specific customer requirements for the Iced Tea beverage industry in North America. The unit is certified under GFSI global food safety standards and all its products are Kosher and Halal Certified.
Amalgamated Plantations Company Private Limited (APPL) is a tea plantation company located in Assam, India, in which Tata Consumer Products Limited has a 41.03% stake. It has operations across 24 tea estates in Assam and North Bengal. The company currently has one fully organic garden — the Hathikuli tea estate located within the Kaziranga National Park in Assam. This garden is now the largest certified organic integrated farm in Asia producing three varieties of tea and black pepper.
For more information, please visit https://amalgamatedplantations.co.in/
